  (@custom "contractspecv0" (after data) "\00\00\00\05\00\00\005`harvest` supplied the asset the strategy held to K2.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0eIdleReinvested\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0fidle_reinvested\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06amount\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\c1`harvest` claimed a reward. `claimed` is the reward that arrived and `proceeds` the asset\0ait became (both measured by balance change); `vest_end` is when everything harvested so\0afar has vested.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fRewardHarvested\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\10reward_harvested\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0creward_token\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07claimed\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08proceeds\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08vest_end\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00x`[id_this, id_market(this, data), id_collateral(aToken)]` (Q109). `InvalidData` for\0aanything but this strategy's router.\00\00\00\03ids\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ea\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00 The asset fixed at construction.\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\90The strategy's books now. Never fails and never writes: with an index below the last\0aone seen or a read that fails, the parts read so far are 0.\00\00\00\05books\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\05Books\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00(The configuration fixed at construction.\00\00\00\06config\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\06Config\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\eeKeeper only (Q108). With `data` (a `HarvestInstruction`), claims all of one reward\0aaccrued on the aToken, swaps it to the asset when it is another token, and adds the\0aproceeds to the vest. Then, with at least `REINVEST_THRESHOLD` idle, supplies all of it.\0aThe instruction is checked before any call (`InvalidData`); a claim or swap K2 or\0aSoroswap refuses is `ProtocolRejected` and reverts everything, so the reward stays\0aclaimable. A supply K2 refuses leaves the asset idle and is not an error.\00\00\00\00\00\07harvest\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\03\e8\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02'Supplies `assets`, pulled from the vault, to K2, and turns the reserve off as the\0astrategy's collateral so no exit reads an oracle price (Q107). Only the bound vault,\0aand only while the factory approves it (`VaultNotApproved` otherwise). `change` is the\0aposition's value now minus the value last recorded. The protocol total grows by\0a`assets` (Q89), less what the principal stood above the value (Q90). K2's refusal\0a(paused, frozen, capped) is `ProtocolRejected`; an index below the last one seen is\0a`ProtocolRejected` before any call (V1's tripwire).\00\00\00\00\08allocate\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06assets\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0aAllocation\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\1cThe vault's stored position.\00\00\00\08position\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\08Position\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\15Pays exactly `assets` to the bound vault, from what the strategy holds first and the\0arest withdrawn from K2 to the strategy (so K2's whitelist never gates the vault).\0aNever gated by approval or the protocol cap. `InsufficientPosition` above the\0aposition's value, or for any other vault. A paused pool or reserve, or too little cash\0aat K2, is `InsufficientLiquidity`; `max_deallocate` reports both. The protocol total\0aloses the principal taken out (all of it on a full exit) and whatever of the rest\0astands above the value (Q89, Q90).\00\00\00\00\00\00\0adeallocate\00\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06assets\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0aAllocation\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\b6The bound vault's position: NAV, rounded down. The value last recorded when the index\0ais below the last one seen or a read fails; 0 for any other vault. Never fails and\0anever writes.\00\00\00\00\00\0breal_assets\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00-The cap on `total_allocated()`; 0 means none.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cprotocol_cap\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\1fBinds the instance to `vault` for good (Q106): no function changes it, and every other\0avault is refused. `factory` decides whether `vault` may still allocate;\0a`cap_authority` alone sets the protocol cap; `keeper` alone may call `harvest`.\0a`router` is K2's router, which must list `asset` (its aToken and reserve id are read\0ahere); `incentives` pays the reserve's emissions; `swap_router` is Soroswap's router.\0a`InvalidConfig` if the router does not answer for `asset`, or unless `vest_seconds` is\0awithin `[MIN_VEST_SECONDS, MAX_VEST_SECONDS]`.\00\00\00\00\0d__constructor\00\00\00\00\00\00\09\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07factory\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dcap_authority\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06router\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0aincentives\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bswap_router\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cvest_seconds\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\94Anyone: lowers the vault's principal, and the protocol total by the same amount, to\0athe position's value when that is lower (a deficit at K2 lowers it), and emits\0a`PrincipalSynced`. Never raises it, moves no money and reports no `change`. Another\0avault, an index below the last one seen, or a read that fails leaves things as they\0aare (Q90). `InvalidData` for a `data` that is not this strategy's router.\00\00\00\0dsync_position\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01XWhat `deallocate(vault, data, x)` can pay now: the position's value, capped by idle\0aplus what K2 can pay (the aTokens' value and the cash the aToken holds). 0 while the\0apool is paused or the reserve is inactive or paused, with the index below the last one\0aseen, on malformed `data`, for another vault or on any failed read (Q107). Never writes.\00\00\00\0emax_deallocate\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\006The vault's principal: put in and not taken out (Q89).\00\00\00\00\00\0ftotal_allocated\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00&Cap authority only. 0 removes the cap.\00\00\00\00\00\10set_protocol_cap\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03cap\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00/The strategy's books as `books()` reports them.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05Books\00\00\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00:`held` less the position's share of the reserve's deficit.\00\00\00\00\00\07counted\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\003The aTokens' value at the live index, rounded down.\00\00\00\00\04held\00\00\00\0b\0